{"4404140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moonlite - 1975", "steam_appid": 4404140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4826940], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a cosmic getaway with <strong>Moonlite </strong>- a lunar looting exploration expedition launching <strong>1975</strong>. Grab your trusty shovel &amp; spacesuit and start digging!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mission 0.5 - Treasure Hunt - Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version includes a single map and game mode by means of 'Mission 0.5 - Treasure Hunt' - a scripted experience showcasing the primary exploration, survival and treasure-hunting loop. Available features are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique surface quadrants to explore - each with their own hazards, treasures and weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 distinct tools to master - compass, flashlight, spade, hammer, detector, radar and receiver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 in-game days to locate the ultimate treasure; you can try for 100% treasures too if you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 controllable styles - explore the surface on-foot and fly through the sky in your lander to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health, oxygen, stamina, temperature, time and fuel management &amp; tracking - keep them stocked!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new tools, abilities, upgrades and extensions at the store using credits and energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looping - 2D, top-down &amp; wrap-around - lunar surface which you can explore as you please</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig up treasure, energy, tools and items to aid your adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest to recover your health, oxygen and stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory, map, clues and objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 Steam achievements to unlock </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 save slot - save at the lander</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lunar lore to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Notes from the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by my love of 2D artwork &amp; gameplay, quirky sci-fi stories, treasure-hunting missions, achievement-completionism and atmospheric, rogue-lite and survival-styled games, <strong>Moonlite - 1975</strong> aims to provide an arcade-like and engaging treasure-hunting experience in which you can tackle the top-down, time-limited mission as you see fit. I hope you enjoy the journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck and Godspeed! Clive Lawrence @ tmwfa</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a cosmic getaway with <strong>Moonlite </strong>- a lunar looting exploration expedition launching <strong>1975</strong>. Grab your trusty shovel &amp; spacesuit and start digging!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mission 0.5 - Treasure Hunt - Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version includes a single map and game mode by means of 'Mission 0.5 - Treasure Hunt' - a scripted experience showcasing the primary exploration, survival and treasure-hunting loop. Available features are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique surface quadrants to explore - each with their own hazards, treasures and weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 distinct tools to master - compass, flashlight, spade, hammer, detector, radar and receiver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 in-game days to locate the ultimate treasure; you can try for 100% treasures too if you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 controllable styles - explore the surface on-foot and fly through the sky in your lander to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health, oxygen, stamina, temperature, time and fuel management &amp; tracking - keep them stocked!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new tools, abilities, upgrades and extensions at the store using credits and energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looping - 2D, top-down &amp; wrap-around - lunar surface which you can explore as you please</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig up treasure, energy, tools and items to aid your adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest to recover your health, oxygen and stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory, map, clues and objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 Steam achievements to unlock </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 save slot - save at the lander</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lunar lore to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Notes from the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by my love of 2D artwork &amp; gameplay, quirky sci-fi stories, treasure-hunting missions, achievement-completionism and atmospheric, rogue-lite and survival-styled games, <strong>Moonlite - 1975</strong> aims to provide an arcade-like and engaging treasure-hunting experience in which you can tackle the top-down, time-limited mission as you see fit. I hope you enjoy the journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck and Godspeed! Clive Lawrence @ tmwfa</p>", "short_description": "Get ready for a cosmic getaway with Moonlite - a lunar looting exploration expedition launching 1975. Grab your trusty shovel &amp; spacesuit and start digging! The current version is Early Access v0.5 - pre-alpha - and includes a single map and game mode called 'Treasure Hunt'.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404140/42ef3b0fe779bdb5f53fa0880cfdaf71ad497a3c/header.jpg?t=1786808291", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404140/4bf92619409601ab06ab34bb75ade1dfe8ef21ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786808291", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4404140/4bf92619409601ab06ab34bb75ade1dfe8ef21ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786808291", "website": "https://www.indiedb.com/games/mom", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support, Arm64<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 or Vulkan capable GPUs<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 115 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Cards supporting .mp3 and .wav formats<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> N/A<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> N/A</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Moonlite - 1975 - game art, code, concept, design and marketing by Clive Alexander Lawrence @ tmwfa (c) 2024-2026<br />\r\nUses selected sound effects from '8-Bit Style Sound Effects' and 'Retro Sci-Fi Pack' - by cabled_mess - and additional royalty-free sounds<br />\r\nUses the fonts Bitwise - by Digital Graphic Labs - and Snake - by Kevin Richey - under freeware licences<br />\r\nThe preview and launch trailers use the song 'The Silent Clues (Main Version)' by Simon Folwar - under a paid license", "developers": ["TMWFA"], "publishers": ["The Man Who Flew Away"], "demos": [{"appid": 4826940, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 299, "final": 299, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$2.99"}, "packages": [1538135], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Moonlite - 19